System Overview & Specifications**

Hardware Architecture

Main Controller (ESP32 Gateway)**

* ESP32 Development Board
* RC522 RFID Reader module
* Emergency SOS Push Button
* Active Buzzer
* Status Indicator LED

Classroom Sub-Nodes**

Node 1: ESP8266
Node 2: ESP8266

---

Pin Configuration & Wiring

RC522 RFID Reader $\rightarrow$ ESP32**

| RC522 Pin | ESP32 GPIO | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| VCC | 3.3V | Power Supply (3.3V only) |
| GND | GND | Ground |
| RST | GPIO 22 | Reset Pin |
| SDA (SS) | GPIO 5 | SPI Chip Select |
| SCK | GPIO 18 | SPI Clock |
| MISO | GPIO 19 | SPI Master In / Slave Out |
| MOSI | GPIO 23 | SPI Master Out / Slave In |
| IRQ | Not Connected | Interrupt Request (Unused) |

Emergency Alert Subsystem $\rightarrow$ ESP32

| Component | ESP32 GPIO | Configuration Type |
| --- | --- | --- |
| SOS Button | GPIO 27 | Digital Input (Pull-up / Pull-down) |
| Active Buzzer | GPIO 26 | Digital Output |
| Alert LED | GPIO 25 | Digital Output |

