Software Stack & Protocols

Development Environment: Arduino IDE
Board Cores:
* ESP32 Arduino Core
* ESP8266 Arduino Core


Libraries: `MFRC522` (by GithubCommunity / Miguel Balboa)
Networking & Protocols:
* Wi-Fi (802.11 b/g/n)
* HTTP / REST Client-Server Communication


Mobile Integration: Automate App (Android) for smartphone GPS logging and automated triggers
